# Felwood - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns whose SOURCE is physically in Felwood,
# verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever item
# drop/vendor tables). All nine ship as mob drops with droppers
# spawning only in Felwood; one (Warbear Woolies) is also bought from
# Meilosh at Timbermaw Hold, so it gets a buy step plus a drop step.
# Everything else Felwood-dropping is a generic multi-zone world drop
# (Elwynn rule, argued per case in the inventory - including the
# two-dropper Mongoose and the dual-zone single-dropper patterns
# shared with Darkshore's ground). Quest records carry no reward data,
# so no quest-reward recipe ships (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides
# cover those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters
# skip it cleanly. Alchemy, Cooking, First Aid and Fishing have no
# Felwood source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/felwood-recipes
title Felwood - Recipes & Patterns
levels 45-55
zone Felwood
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords felwood, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Deadwood north - living leggings (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1448

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  loop
  goto 60.14,7.39
  goto 60.27,5.91
  goto 60.37,8.82
  goto 61.37,10.61
  goto 61.46,11.15
  goto 62.33,9.25
  goto 62.41,6.31
  goto 62.42,12.69
  goto 62.48,11.56
  goto 62.63,11.22
  goto 62.71,7.14
  goto 63.06,10.9
  goto 63.64,9.11
  goto 63.66,12.34
  goto 64.01,6.79
  kill 7158 optional
  collect 15752 "Pattern: Living Leggings" optional
  note The Deadwood Shaman is the sole dropper anywhere in the data and spawns only in Felwood. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Meilosh - warbear woolies (buy)

  zone map 1448

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 11557 -- Meilosh (65.69, 2.81)
  buy 15754 "Pattern: Warbear Woolies"
  note Meilosh (Timbermaw, neutral) sells the pattern at his Felwood hold; Deadwood furbolgs below also drop it. Stock class unconfirmed.

